---
// Muzzle — Landing Page
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Muzzle — Voice Privacy & Control</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050d1a 0%, #0f1f35 100%);
            color: #e0e0e0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem);
            color: #a0a0a0;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            background: #0066ff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .cta:hover {
            background: #0052cc;
        }

        .status {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: rgba(0, 102, 255, 0.1);
            border-left: 4px solid #0066ff;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .status h3 {
            color: #0066ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .status p {
            color: #a0a0a0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Muzzle</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Voice Privacy & Control</p>
        
        <div class="status">
            <h3>🚀 Early Development</h3>
            <p>We're building something great. Check back soon for updates.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="#" class="cta">Learn More</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
